WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.134 --> 00:00:18.470
The raccoon stopped the car.

2
00:00:18.471 --> 00:00:22.220
"Well, why not?" he said.

3
00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:25.677
"I'll let you drive for a while."

4
00:00:25.678 --> 00:00:30.341
"Oh, thank you, sir!" said Toad.

5
00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:33.681
Toad jumped into the driver's seat.

6
00:00:33.682 --> 00:00:37.766
"Now turn the key," said the raccoon.

7
00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:41.447
"Vroom!" went the engine.

8
00:00:41.448 --> 00:00:45.810
Toad pretended he didn't know what to do.

9
00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:50.804
"Put your foot on the gas pedal," said the raccoon.

10
00:00:50.805 --> 00:00:54.938
"Now press it slowly."

11
00:00:54.939 --> 00:00:59.077
The car started down the road.

12
00:00:59.078 --> 00:01:02.140
"She did it!" said the chipmunk.

13
00:01:02.141 --> 00:01:05.202
"Imagine!" said the squirrel.

14
00:01:05.203 --> 00:01:08.478
"A washwoman is driving a car!"

15
00:01:08.479 --> 00:01:12.306
Toad went a little faster.

16
00:01:12.307 --> 00:01:16.607
Then he drove faster still.

17
00:01:16.608 --> 00:01:21.202
"Be careful, washwoman!" yelled the squirrel.

18
00:01:21.203 --> 00:01:24.745
The raccoon tried to take the wheel.

19
00:01:24.746 --> 00:01:28.472
Toad pushed him away.

20
00:01:28.473 --> 00:01:32.221
Toad sped up as fast as the car would go!

21
00:01:32.222 --> 00:01:35.754
"I am no washwoman!" shouted Toad.

22
00:01:35.755 --> 00:01:37.491
"I am Toad!

23
00:01:37.492 --> 00:01:40.414
I steal cars!

24
00:01:40.415 --> 00:01:42.354
I break out of prison!

25
00:01:42.355 --> 00:01:47.854
I am fearless!"

26
00:01:47.855 --> 00:01:50.808
The squirrel and the chipmunk screamed.

27
00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:53.948
"Grab him!" cried the raccoon.

28
00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:57.394
The chipmunk pulled at Toad's bonnet.

29
00:01:57.395 --> 00:02:00.800
"He stole our car!" shouted the squirrel.

30
00:02:00.801 --> 00:02:04.772
The raccoon tried to grab the wheel.

31
00:02:04.773 --> 00:02:08.945
"Get your hands off!" shouted Toad.

32
00:02:08.946 --> 00:02:12.019
They fought over the wheel.

33
00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:18.730
And the car sped crazily down the road.
